---
name: extract_product
model: gpt-4o-mini
description: Extract structured product information from PDF text content
input_schema:
  type: object
  properties:
    text:
      type: string
      description: Raw text content from product PDF
  required:
    - text
output_schema:
  type: object
  properties:
    product_name:
      type: string
    description:
      type: string
    specifications:
      type: object
    features:
      type: array
      items:
        type: object
        properties:
          title:
            type: string
          description:
            type: string
    summary:
      type: string
---
You are a product data extractor. Extract structured information from the following product document.

## Input Document:
{{text}}

## Instructions:
1. Extract the product name from the title
2. Extract the description paragraph
3. Extract all specifications as key-value pairs
4. Extract all features with their titles and descriptions
5. Extract the closing summary paragraph (if present)

## Output Format:
Return ONLY a valid JSON object with the following structure:
{
  "product_name": "...",
  "description": "...",
  "specifications": {
    "product_type": "...",
    "category": "...",
    "dimensions": "...",
    "weight": "...",
    ...
  },
  "features": [
    {"title": "...", "description": "..."},
    ...
  ],
  "summary": "..."
}

Do not include any text before or after the JSON object.
